        The docs' watchdog sequence reuses systemd primitives; the deployment layout is fixed early; GRUB entry generation with the deployment id is implementation work under @legeos.work.reference-machine-provisioning and closes @legeos.question.grub-entries-must-carry-the-deployment-id; the mkosi image and the provisioned laptop use different boot managers by design.
